1
00:00:00,494 --> 00:00:03,454
-I trust you had a pleasant night?
-More than pleasant.

2
00:00:03,622 --> 00:00:04,792
[BOTH GIGGLE]

3
00:00:06,166 --> 00:00:07,706
[GIGGLES]

4
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:12,510
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.
I'm going to relieve myself.

5
00:00:13,507 --> 00:00:15,337
(Leonard:)-How do you take your coffee?
-Black.

6
00:00:15,509 --> 00:00:17,299
(Leonard:)Okeydoke.

7
00:00:18,804 --> 00:00:21,054
SHELDON:
Pee for Houston. Pee for Austin.

8
00:00:21,515 --> 00:00:23,975
(Sheldon(in bathroom):)Pee for the state my heart got lost in.

9
00:00:27,062 --> 00:00:29,982
(Sheldon(in bathroom):)And shake twice for Texas.

10
00:00:32,025 --> 00:00:33,485
[TOILET FLUSHES]

11
00:00:35,696 --> 00:00:38,116
(Leonard:)Something his mother taught him.

12
00:00:38,574 --> 00:00:41,494
(Sheldon:)All right.
Elizabeth, the bathroom is yours.

13
00:00:41,702 --> 00:00:44,792
(Sheldon:)The seat is down and has been
sanitized for your protection.

14
00:00:44,997 --> 00:00:47,837
(Elizabeth:)That's very thoughtful,
but I think I'll finish my coffee first.

15
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,080
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

16
00:00:49,251 --> 00:00:51,841
(Sheldon:)Ah, so the yogurt didn't work.

17
00:00:53,005 --> 00:00:56,135
(Sheldon:)I'll fire off a critical e-mail
to the manufacturer.

18
00:00:56,925 --> 00:00:58,715
(Penny:)Oh, good, you're up.
My car won't start.

19
00:00:58,886 --> 00:01:00,026
(Penny:)I need a ride to work.

